OL,3,AVeterans shouldn't sleep rough this
OL,4,AChristmas, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo one who served in the UK armed
OL,7,Fforces should have to sleep on the
OL,8,Fstreets this Christmas, Andy Burnham
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FDowning Street said the prime minister
OL,12,Fwill personally write to councils
OL,13,Facross England on Armistice Day (11
OL,14,FNovember) to urge them to draw up
OL,15,Fspecific plans to offer accommodation
OL,16,Ffor veterans sleeping rough ahead of
OL,17,Fthe festive period.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
